# Jentic One Docker quickstart — the trial shape from the README.
# All three backing stores as SQLite files on one volume (mount it at /data),
# development-mode secrets, no TLS. Tweak freely — any config key can be set
# here using the JENTIC__SECTION__KEY convention (see config/README.md).
# The production shape (external Postgres, real secrets, TLS) is
# docs/installation/docker.md.
JENTIC__DATABASES__REGISTRY__BACKEND=sqlite
JENTIC__DATABASES__REGISTRY__PATH=/data/registry.db
JENTIC__DATABASES__CONTROL__BACKEND=sqlite
JENTIC__DATABASES__CONTROL__PATH=/data/control.db
JENTIC__DATABASES__ADMIN__BACKEND=sqlite
JENTIC__DATABASES__ADMIN__PATH=/data/admin.db
